{"id":"20744306a701f3a7","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-thm-levy-collapse.md","title":"Levy Collapse Theorem","display":"thm-levy-collapse — Levy Collapse Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-levy-collapse","aliases":["58-thm-levy-collapse"],"display":"thm-levy-collapse — Levy Collapse Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-collapse]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","[[58-df-inaccessible]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-ctm]]","[[58-df-name]]","[[58-df-forcing-relation]]","[[58-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-levy-collapse"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-levy-collapse</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-levy-collapse — Levy Collapse Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"db7c5834b8f0957b\" href=\"?note=db7c5834b8f0957b\" title=\"58-df-collapse\">58-df-collapse</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"06ee5d7ff126e916\" href=\"?note=06ee5d7ff126e916\" title=\"58-df-inaccessible\">58-df-inaccessible</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"58-df-ctm\">58-df-ctm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"58-df-name\">58-df-name</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"46b2495f214783c3\" href=\"?note=46b2495f214783c3\" title=\"58-df-forcing-relation\">58-df-forcing-relation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu,P,R,\\check\\kappa,\\check\\lambda,\\check\\mu\\in V\">\\(M,\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu,P,R,\\check\\kappa,\\check\\lambda,\\check\\mu\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\\in\\mathsf{Theory}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\in\\mathsf{Theory}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S,\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S,\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S,\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S,\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S^M\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S^M\\)</span> is the cardinal predicate relativized to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTM}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CTM}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Name}\">\\(\\mathrm{Name}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\)</span> are the typed predicates from the dependencies</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{\\mathrm{succ}}(v_0,v_1)\">\\(\\varphi_{\\mathrm{succ}}(v_0,v_1)\\)</span> says that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_1=v_0^+\">\\(v_1=v_0^+\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{\\mathrm{card}}(v_0)\">\\(\\varphi_{\\mathrm{card}}(v_0)\\)</span> says that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span> is a cardinal</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}levy\\text{-}collapse}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC})\n\\land\\kappa,\\lambda,\\check\\kappa,\\check\\lambda\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S(\\lambda)\n\\land\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land P=\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)\n\\land R=\\leq_{\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)}\n\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\check\\kappa,P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\check\\lambda,P)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,\\varnothing,\\varphi_{\\mathrm{succ}},\\langle\\check\\kappa,\\check\\lambda\\rangle,P,R)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\mu\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\mu)\\land\\lambda\\leq\\mu\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S^M(\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\check\\mu,P)\n\\to\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,\\varnothing,\\varphi_{\\mathrm{card}},\\langle\\check\\mu\\rangle,P,R)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}levy\\text{-}collapse}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC})\n\\land\\kappa,\\lambda,\\check\\kappa,\\check\\lambda\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S(\\lambda)\n\\land\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land P=\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)\n\\land R=\\leq_{\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)}\n\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\check\\kappa,P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\check\\lambda,P)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,\\varnothing,\\varphi_{\\mathrm{succ}},\\langle\\check\\kappa,\\check\\lambda\\rangle,P,R)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\mu\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\mu)\\land\\lambda\\leq\\mu\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S^M(\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\check\\mu,P)\n\\to\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,\\varnothing,\\varphi_{\\mathrm{card}},\\langle\\check\\mu\\rangle,P,R)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ground model, collapse order, top condition, formula codes, and name tuples are explicit. The two conclusions say that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> becomes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa^+\">\\(\\kappa^+\\)</span> and that every ground-model cardinal at least <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> remains a cardinal.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-collapse","status":"resolved","id":"db7c5834b8f0957b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-collapse]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-inaccessible","status":"resolved","id":"06ee5d7ff126e916","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-inaccessible]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ctm","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-6","targetAn